# Local SQLite databases built by db/apply.mjs, db/seed/*, db/measure.mjs.
# Disposable: `npm run db:check` recreates them from migrations/ and the
# question bank in one command, so there is nothing here worth committing.
.local/

# Miniflare / wrangler local state, including the local D1 database that
# `wrangler d1 migrations apply --local` writes to.
.wrangler/

# Drizzle tooling output. Nothing here is the source of truth -- the SQL in
# migrations/ is (see db/schema.ts), and a generated migration would silently
# drop STRICT, the triggers and the FTS5 table.
drizzle/
